{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222030","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1522203001:1":{"text":"你们不能这样……你们的生活已经比很多人都好了，为什么还要跟我们这些快要饿死的人抢赈灾粮？","source_cn":"你们不能这样……你们的生活已经比很多人都好了，为什么还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC81E3EA12DDA984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522203002:0":{"text":"这根本……咳咳！不公平……","source_cn":"这根本……咳咳！不公平……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA04A130D9F7E0EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522203003:0":{"text":"有什么公不公平的？你们没钱又不是我的错！","source_cn":"有什么公不公平的？你们没钱又不是我的错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4535D3BAAB479176","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522203004:1":{"text":"饥荒这么久，你们没东西，难道我们就有吗？整个呼临城谁没受灾？","source_cn":"饥荒这么久，你们没东西，难道我们就有吗？整个呼临城谁没受灾？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEE2DE0500CB9EB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522203005:0":{"text":"但是你们……咳……你们不缺粮食！你们有钱买啊……！","source_cn":"但是你们……咳……你们不缺粮食！你们有钱买啊……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EC32567D46E6ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522203006:0":{"text":"谁说我有钱了？呼临城和整片高原都干旱，我家的农田一点收成都没有，还欠着不少外债！我哪有什么钱？","source_cn":"谁说我有钱了？呼临城和整片高原都干旱，我家的农田一点收...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182EADFA89F3AC76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522203007:0":{"text":"你看看你穿的是什么，我们穿的是什么！","source_cn":"你看看你穿的是什么，我们穿的是什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85CB9E5EE0C76418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522203008:0":{"text":"要是你还没钱，我——","source_cn":"要是你还没钱，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5D235F1A245893B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522203009:0":{"text":"——吵什么吵！都给我闭嘴！","source_cn":"——吵什么吵！都给我闭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417A5D78313DC653","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522203010:0":{"text":"卡利安，怎么回事？","source_cn":"卡利安，怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE7E5554E66344E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522203011:0":{"text":"报告副将，是……是有人插队，其他人有所不满……","source_cn":"报告副将，是……是有人插队，其他人有所不满……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B86F4F6EA3518E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1522203012:0":{"text":"丢人现眼的蠢货，发放赈灾粮这点差事你都干不好，回去写十篇检讨交给我！明天就要！","source_cn":"丢人现眼的蠢货，发放赈灾粮这点差事你都干不好，回去写十...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA2A1E6698136023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1522203013:0":{"text":"至于你们，全都给我站成一列，不许争抢，不然粮食不予发放！","source_cn":"至于你们，全都给我站成一列，不许争抢，不然粮食不予发放！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADB907A02F563F3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522203014:1":{"text":"现在已经不是插队的问题了！是他这种有钱人凭什么来领赈灾粮！","source_cn":"现在已经不是插队的问题了！是他这种有钱人凭什么来领赈灾粮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92EF874F488978D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522203015:0":{"text":"你是副将？<style=\"highlight\">珀尔修斯统帅的副将</style>，对不对？你一定要替我们做主才行！","source_cn":"你是副将？<style=highlight>珀尔修斯统...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D874ABAD0A8900A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1522203016:0":{"text":"还要怎么给你们做主？难不成要把所有赈灾粮都运到你家里去？","source_cn":"还要怎么给你们做主？难不成要把所有赈灾粮都运到你家里去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x350AA42C69128525","variant_st